@Gargron That makes sense!

Optionally, I would encourage letting folks know about this change (via `@Mastodon@mastodon.social`, part of a blog post, or something else?) before/near stable release.

This would give those who have come to expect no built-in full text search time to learn about opting-out of this new feature by turning off discoverability before it is widely deployed, while also giving those who have asked for more full-text search a pleasant heads up that something they want is coming soon.
